5. GSTR Period and Invoice Date are separate.
6. Filing Date is separate.
7. Reverse Charge is independent.
8. ITC Availability reflects the source field.
9. Do not declare legal ITC eligibility merely because the source says Yes.
10. Applicable % of Tax Rate is not necessarily the GST tax rate.
11. Preserve missing values.
12. Do not silently correct source values.
13. GSTR Period determines monthly organisation.
14. Do not use current month or upload date as a substitute for GSTR Period.
15. Do not infer a missing GSTR Period from Invoice Date.

Display data discrepancies as warnings, not automatic corrections.

